        },
        {
          "doc_id": "official-v2-response-status-code",
          "quote": "200 - 299 are for \"Successful\" responses. These are the ones you would use the most. 200 is the default status code, which means everything was \"OK\". Another example would be 201 , \"Created\". It is commonly used after creating a new record in the database. A special case is 204 , \"No Content\".  This response is used when there is no content to return to the client, and so the response must not have a body.",
